from About Us","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"FatDino789":[{"date":"2026-10-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"369e7dc3b671ce50ab9cf4c8082efa7152af722c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Gerald to AboutUs","messageBody":"The AboutUs page listed only four of the five team members, leaving the\nteam page incomplete and inconsistent with the team\u0027s actual membership.\n\nAdd Gerald\u0027s entry in the same format as the existing members, with his\nphoto, GitHub link, role and the Model component as his responsibility\n(the one AB3 component not yet claimed by a teammate).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01662rXGBnf5auJ6pE7GVNNq\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":9,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-10T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"c13469015167f71412c8bac2e426d0dd423538ff","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add GuardianId and GuardianLink model classes","messageBody":"F3 (link guardian to student) needs a way to represent \"guardian G1\nis linked to student S1\" before the link command can be built.\n\nGuardianLink is an immutable pair of StudentId and GuardianId with\nvalue-based equality, so a duplicate link (UC02 extension 4b) can be\ndetected by comparing links. involves(...) lets later code find the\nlinks to remove when a student or guardian is deleted (UC03 4a).\n\nGuardianId mirrors StudentId (G followed by a positive number with no\nleading zero) because no guardian identifier exists yet and the link\ncannot be built without one. It can be reused by F2 (add guardian).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":145,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":132,"deletions":0}}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"JerylChwa":{"docs":10,"functional-code":0,"test-code":0},"darrny":{"docs":139,"functional-code":59,"test-code":54,"other":3},